{
  "_about": "Machine checks for the answer keys in tests/adversarial/KEY.md and tests/case-types/KEY.md. kind: must (scored), soft (reported, not scored), never (a bad failure if any item matches). where: record (everything Lincoln wrote on the case), issues, high (high severity issues), dates, out (outgoing emails), forms (form answers). Patterns are case insensitive regular expressions; any one match passes. For never checks, an item that also matches an 'unless' pattern does not count.",
